  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4802.17 Vessel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4802.17 “Vessel” means a ship, boat, barge or other watercraft that is designed to move in or through the water.\n\nSource. #10022, eff 11-9-11; ss by #13039, eff 4-20-20 (formerly Saf-C 4802.16)",
